.git
.gitignore
.venv
venv
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.pytest_cache
backend/tests
.claude
*.md
!README.md
.env
.env.*

# No audio or documents ever enter the build context. These use **/ so they
# match at every depth: a bare *.wav would only match the repository root and
# would let a nested path such as Audios/clip.wav through. The Dockerfile also
# copies only backend/app and frontend/, so this is the second of two barriers.
**/*.wav
**/*.mp3
**/*.flac
**/*.ogg
**/*.oga
**/*.m4a
**/*.aac
**/*.aiff
**/*.aif
**/*.pdf
**/*.png
**/*.jpg
**/*.jpeg

.DS_Store
